<title>UK: Tambang Timah at $15.5 in London.</title>
<headline>Tambang Timah at $15.5 in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Tambang Timah closed at $15.5 per GDR in London on Friday. It recorded the day's low of $15.275 and the day's high of $15.56.</p>
<p>It closed at $15.5 on Thursday.</p>
<p>One Global Depository Receipt represents 10 common shares. -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
